  <section id="postgrest-documentation">
<h1>PostgREST Documentation<a class="headerlink" href="#postgrest-documentation" title="Link to this heading"></a></h1>
<div class="image-container docutils container">
<figure class="align-default">
<img alt="_images/postgrest.png" src="_images/postgrest.png" />
</figure>
</div>
<a class="reference external image-reference" href="https://github.com/PostgREST/postgrest"><img alt="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/postgrest/postgrest.svg?style=social" src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/postgrest/postgrest.svg?style=social" />
</a>
<a class="reference external image-reference" href="https://github.com/PostgREST/postgrest/releases"><img alt="https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PostgREST/postgrest.svg" src="https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PostgREST/postgrest.svg" />
</a>
<a class="reference external image-reference" href="https://hub.docker.com/r/postgrest/postgrest/"><img alt="https://img.shields.io/docker/pulls/postgrest/postgrest.svg" src="https://img.shields.io/docker/pulls/postgrest/postgrest.svg" />
</a>
<a class="reference external image-reference" href="https://www.patreon.com/postgrest"><img alt="https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Patreon-orange.svg?colorB=F96854" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Patreon-orange.svg?colorB=F96854" />
</a>
<div class="line-block">
<div class="line"><br /></div>
</div>
<p>PostgREST is a standalone web server that turns your PostgreSQL database directly into a RESTful API. The structural constraints and permissions in the database determine the API endpoints and operations.</p>
<section id="sponsors">
<h2>Sponsors<a class="headerlink" href="#sponsors" title="Link to this heading"></a></h2>
